rice_usd":4.0},{"category":"cocktail","label":"cocktails","price_usd":8.0},{"category":"food","label":"Tap nachos","price_usd":8.0},{"category":"draft","label":"drafts","price_usd":4.0},{"category":"wine","label":"house wine","price_usd":4.0},{"category":"food","label":"small plates featuring Southe","price_usd":6.0}],"confidence":"unconfirmed","last_verified_at":"2026-09-02","verified_by":"roundup_extract","source":{"kind":"roundup","url":"https://countylinesmagazine.com/article/cheers-its-happy-hour-in-west-chester-pa/","outlet":"County Lines Magazine","published":"2024-05-30","quote":"Looking for a place to pop in for a quick drink? There\u2019s plenty of room at Santino\u2019s snaking granite bar. Happy Hour runs Monday through Friday, 5 to 7. Enjoy $5 Tito\u2019s, $6 wine and $3.50 domestic bottles. 40 E. Market St. SantinosTapAndTable.com","quotes":["Looking for a place to pop in for a quick drink? There\u2019s plenty of room at Santino\u2019s snaking granite bar. Happy Hour runs Monday through Friday, 5 to 7. Enjoy $5 Tito\u2019s, $6 wine and $3.50 domestic bottles. 40 E. Market St. SantinosTapAndTable.com","The day starts happy at Sterling Pig. Happy Hour begins when the bar opens at 4. Choose from a rotating list of small-batch beers, all crafted by the Sterling Pig \u201cbrew crew,\u201d each $2 off. Plus, select half-price appetizers, like the Texas taquitos and Bavarian pretzel, along with $6 wines and $5 Boardroom mixed drinks. Happy Hour on weekdays, 4 to 6. 113 W. Market St. SterlingPig.com","Every Monday through Friday from 5 to 7, Stove & Tap hosts Tappy Hour. As you\u2019d expect, it\u2019s full of drink specials, like $3 domestic drafts, $4 wines and $8 cocktails, but there\u2019s also a fair selection of modern American pub fare. Order $8 Tap nachos or crispy Brussels sprouts for the table and you\u2019ll be the hit of Tappy Hour. 153 W. Gay St. StoveAndTap-WC.com","The Social\u2019s full wraparound bar offers plenty of space for you and your friends to sidle up to. There are sofas, too, if you prefer your space. Happy Hour is Wednesday through Friday, 4 to 6 at the bar. Choose from $4 drafts, $4 house wine and $6 small plates featuring Southern home cooking. Cheers! 117 E. Gay St. TheSocialWC.com","Wrong Crowd is located just outside the downtown district in a converted warehouse, but you\u2019re not there for the scenery. Last year Wrong Crowd was named one of the country\u2019s fastest-growing breweries. Want to know why? Stop by during Happy Hour and try a pint for just $4. Happy Hour runs Wednesday and Thursday, 4 to 6, and Friday, 3 to 5. 342 Hannum Ave. WrongCrowdBeer.com"],"note":"County Lines Magazine, May 2024"}}]},{"id":"101577","lid":"101577","slug":"101577","name":"Sedona Taphouse","address":"44 W Gay St, West Chester PA 19380","zone_id":"west_chester","website":"https://sedonataphouse.com/locations/west-chester-pa/","plcb_name":"SEDONA TAPHOUSE","license_type":"Restaurant (Liquor)","lat":39.9600335,"lng":-75.6058116,"geo_precision":"place","photo":{"attribution":"Photo: Constantine Johns / Google","file":"img/venues/101577.jpg"},"deals":[{"confidence":"likely","items":[{"category":"wine","label":"House Wine by the glass","price_usd":7.9},{"category":"wine","label":"Red or White Sangria","price_usd":8.9},{"category":"cocktail","label":"STH Mule","price_usd":9.9},{"category":"cocktail","label":"Prickly Pear Margarita","price_usd":9.9},{"category":"cocktail","label":"Classic Old Fashioned","price_usd":9.9},{"category":"food","label":"Truffle Fries","price_usd":9.9},{"category":"food","label":"Guacamole","price_usd":9.9},{"category":"food","label":"Goat Cheese + Tomato Bruschetta","price_usd":9.9},{"category":"food","label":"Margherita Flatbread","price_usd":10.9},{"category":"food","label":"BBQ Chicken Flatbread","price_usd":10.9},{"category":"food","label":"South Rim Shrimp Flatbread","price_usd":10.9},{"category":"food","label":"Goat Cheese + Basil Flatbread","price_usd":10.9},{"category":"food